A value that YAML would reload as a non-string (a date) is written single-quoted so it round-trips as the string it was.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: draft
sp: 0
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md when=2026-01-01
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 ---
 status: draft
 sp: 0
+when: '2026-01-01'
 ---
 
 Body.
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: when=2026-01-01
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
status: draft
sp: 0
when: '2026-01-01'
---

Body.
-- exit --
0
